# Quality gates (lcd-monitor-mini)

Dev client is Windows. Gates (build/test/security/Hermes) run on **Debian LAN**.

## Day-to-day

1. Commit on `staging`.
2. `./scripts/push-and-wait.ps1 -ProjectId lcd-monitor-mini` (or `git push lan staging`).
3. Read `.gate-reports/last-result.json` and `.gate-reports/last-report.md`.

## On FAIL

Summarize findings, propose a remediation plan, **stop**. Do not change product code until human approval.

## On PASS (release)

Promote on Debian only (`-Promote` or `promote-to-github.sh`). Do not `git push origin main` as the normal path from Windows.

## Hard rules

- Never reimplement gitleaks/Trivy/Hermes on this PC.
- Never commit `.gate-reports/`.
